From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:22:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/22] libcameraservice: wire HAL1 CameraClient into
 CameraService and flashlight

makeClient() creates a CameraClient for CAMERA_DEVICE_API_VERSION_1_0 when the
Camera API1 is used (API2 still gets ERROR_DEPRECATED_HAL). Restore
CameraHardwareInterfaceFlashControl, the preview-based torch emulation used when
the provider does not support setTorchMode, replacing the removed GLConsumer
sink by a BufferItemConsumer. Add the new sources to Android.bp and let
CameraClient reach CameraService::mActiveClientManager.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Idf38a5b1847d223b1877582552bf9ba624f8a1a4
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
